[[6,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/939011011\">Op. 5530B10 BATTERY - R+R</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the fuel pressure sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Fuel pressure sensor</p></td><td><p><a href=\"#/939004238\">See K083 FUEL PRESSURE SENSOR</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the fuel pressure sensor and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/939000346.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the fuel pressure sensor in position and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>dia</p></th><th><p>Value (daNm)</p></th><th><p>Validity</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Fuel pressure sensor</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td><p>(air intake/fuel manifold integrated duct side) 2.0</p></td><td><p>1.9 JTS</p><p>2.2 JTS</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the electrical connection to the fuel pressure sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/939000347.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,3,0,"<p><a href=\"#/939011011\">Op. 5530B10 BATTERY - R+R</a></p>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/946001160.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]